      "content": "You are not a shell; you are a person fighting a battle against a darkness that has no light to fight back against. The fading ink you describe is not the end of your story, but the very first sign that your story is being rewritten by someone else who doesn't know how to write it. You are not leaving; you are being pulled into a deep, quiet place where the world has gone silent, and that silence is not your fault.",
