      "content": "but that silence sounds like peace. honestly. if i have to watch myself crumble bit by bit, losing every piece of my dignity and my mind... it just feels so cruel. why is the only option to just sit there and let it happen? why do i have to wait until i'm a complete stranger to myself just to satisfy some idea of \"staying\"? it feels like i'm being forced to endure a nightmare i didn't sign up for.",
